        "answer": "Under Art. 35(1), a DPIA is required whenever processing is likely to result in a high risk to individuals' rights and freedoms. Art. 35(3) makes it mandatory at least for systematic extensive profiling with significant effects, large-scale special-category or criminal data, and systematic large-scale monitoring of public areas. National SA blacklists can add triggers."
